<title>USA: Exxon gets $368.2 mln US defense contract.</title>
<headline>Exxon gets $368.2 mln US defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Co USA, a division of Exxon Corp, has received a $368.2 million U.S. defense contract for jet fuel, the Pentagon's Defense Logistics Agency said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
